    "from": "This comes from Dubai Future Week on 20 November. The event is called “The Future Generations Trial: What Future Did You Promise Us?” It is a pretend courtroom. Young people speak for people of the future. Leaders stand up for today’s decisions. A jury of different ages decides.",
